            stem: "Congress enacts a statute making it a federal crime to possess a firearm within 1,000 feet of a public school. The statute contains no requirement that the firearm have moved in or affected interstate commerce, and Congress made no findings about its effect on commerce. A man who was carrying a handgun in a parking lot next to a school, who is a college student with no criminal record and says that he did not know the school was nearby, is prosecuted under the statute and argues that Congress lacked the power to enact it.",
