            status: "general", src: "U.S. Const. art. II, §2, cl. 2 (read on LII); Buckley v. Valeo, 424 U.S. 1 (1976); Edmond v. United States (1997); Lucia v. SEC (2018); NLRB v. Noel Canning (2014); United States v. Arthrex, Inc. (2021); conlaw.md §6.2",
