            status: "general", src: "New York v. United States, 505 U.S. 144 (1992); Printz v. United States, 521 U.S. 898 (1997); Murphy v. NCAA (2018); Reno v. Condon (2000); Garcia v. SAMTA (1985); conlaw.md §7.1",
